translate turkish izzymoviedatestart_481be106:

    # gl "Yeah. I need to get out of the damn house for a while, that's for sure."
    gl "Evet. Bir süreliğine bu lanet evden çıkmam lazım, orası kesin."

# game/Scenes/Izzy/IzzyDates/izzymoviedate.rpy:28
translate turkish izzymoviedatestart_5b0e3d1a:

    # pc "Well, you look nice."
    pc "Eh, güzel görünüyorsun."

# game/Scenes/Izzy/IzzyDates/izzymoviedate.rpy:29
translate turkish izzymoviedatestart_ddae2ca0:

    # gl "Thanks Twig. I put on a shirt, just for you."
    gl "Teşekkürler Twig. Sırf senin için bir gömlek giydim."

# game/Scenes/Izzy/IzzyDates/izzymoviedate.rpy:30
translate turkish izzymoviedatestart_0ee370cd:

    # pc "Aw, you shouldn't have."
    pc "Ah, gerek yoktu ki."

# game/Scenes/Izzy/IzzyDates/izzymoviedate.rpy:33
translate turkish izzymoviedatestart_d41d8cd9:

    # voice 'voices/izzy_whatsup.mp3'
    voice 'voices/izzy_whatsup.mp3'

# game/Scenes/Izzy/IzzyDates/izzymoviedate.rpy:34
translate turkish izzymoviedatestart_01687529:

    # gl "What's up, Twig. Let's go see this movie."
    gl "Naber Twig? Hadi gidip bu filmi izleyelim."

# game/Scenes/Izzy/IzzyDates/izzymoviedate.rpy:38
translate turkish izzymoviedatestart_00bfd309:

    # gl "This is kinda fun actually. Been a while since I've gone to the movies."
    gl "Aslında bu biraz eğlenceli. Sinemaya gitmeyeli epey oldu."

# game/Scenes/Izzy/IzzyDates/izzymoviedate.rpy:39
translate turkish izzymoviedatestart_3746eb4d:

    # gl "Except taking my brothers to see Shrek and shit."
    gl "Kardeşlerimi Shrek falan izlemeye götürmek hariç tabii."

# game/Scenes/Izzy/IzzyDates/izzymoviedate.rpy:40
translate turkish izzymoviedatestart_fefe72bc:

    # gl "Not on a date or anything, anyways."
    gl "Zaten randevu falan değil."

# game/Scenes/Izzy/IzzyDates/izzymoviedate.rpy:41
translate turkish izzymoviedatestart_a14fd1a7:

    # pc "So it is a date?"
    pc "Yani bu bir randevu mu?"

# game/Scenes/Izzy/IzzyDates/izzymoviedate.rpy:43
translate turkish izzymoviedatestart_92636968:

    # gl "You want to date me? Like, seriously?"
    gl "Benimle çıkmak mı istiyorsun? Cidden mi?"

# game/Scenes/Izzy/IzzyDates/izzymoviedate.rpy:46
translate turkish izzymoviedatestart_4e0b05f2:

    # gl "You know I'm not into the whole monogamy thing though, right?"
    gl "Tek eşlilik olayına pek sıcak bakmadığımı biliyorsun, değil mi?"

# game/Scenes/Izzy/IzzyDates/izzymoviedate.rpy:47
translate turkish izzymoviedatestart_e9418800:

    # pc "I'm not really either."
    pc "Ben de pek değilim aslında."

# game/Scenes/Izzy/IzzyDates/izzymoviedate.rpy:48
translate turkish izzymoviedatestart_4dabe89e:

    # gl "So you keep fucking who you want and I keep fucking who I want, but we also go on dates and fuck each other?"
    gl "Yani sen istediğinle yatmaya devam edersin, ben de istediğimle yatmaya devam ederim, ama aynı zamanda randevulara çıkar ve birbirimizle sevişiriz?"

# game/Scenes/Izzy/IzzyDates/izzymoviedate.rpy:49
translate turkish izzymoviedatestart_0aa625bf:

    # pc "I mean, that sounds cool to me."
    pc "Yani, bana kulağa hoş geliyor."

# game/Scenes/Izzy/IzzyDates/izzymoviedate.rpy:51
translate turkish izzymoviedatestart_0933ffde:

    # gl "Me too. Let's just keep it simple. As long as you're not trying to chain me down, I'm happy with the situation."
    gl "Bana da. İşleri basit tutalım. Beni bağlamaya çalışmadığın sürece, durumdan memnunum."

# game/Scenes/Izzy/IzzyDates/izzymoviedate.rpy:52
translate turkish izzymoviedatestart_2843a332:

    # gl "The moment you tell me I can't do what I want to do, we'll have problems."
    gl "Bana istediğim şeyi yapamayacağımı söylediğin an, sorunlar başlar."

# game/Scenes/Izzy/IzzyDates/izzymoviedate.rpy:53
translate turkish izzymoviedatestart_0d652c29:

    # pc "I wouldn't do that."
    pc "Ben öyle bir şey yapmam."

# game/Scenes/Izzy/IzzyDates/izzymoviedate.rpy:55
translate turkish izzymoviedatestart_2e09af75:

    # gl "Cool. We can date then. We're dating."
    gl "Harika. O zaman çıkabiliriz. Çıkıyoruz."

# game/Scenes/Izzy/IzzyDates/izzymoviedate.rpy:56
translate turkish izzymoviedatestart_9900eca8:

    # pc "Cool."
    pc "Harika."

# game/Scenes/Izzy/IzzyDates/izzymoviedate.rpy:60
translate turkish izzymoviedatestart_208b86a1:

    # gl "Cool, that's all I want. You fuck who you want, and I fuck who I want."
    gl "Harika, tek istediğim bu. Sen kiminle istersen seviş, ben de kiminle istersem sevişirim."

# game/Scenes/Izzy/IzzyDates/izzymoviedate.rpy:61
translate turkish izzymoviedatestart_92ed55df:

    # gl "And if we want to go see a movie, or grab dinner together, we don't have to call it dating."
    gl "Ve eğer sinemaya gitmek ya da birlikte akşam yemeği yemek istersek, buna çıkmak demek zorunda değiliz."

# game/Scenes/Izzy/IzzyDates/izzymoviedate.rpy:62
translate turkish izzymoviedatestart_df196688:

    # gl "We're just watching a movie."
    gl "Sadece film izliyoruz."

# game/Scenes/Izzy/IzzyDates/izzymoviedate.rpy:63
translate turkish izzymoviedatestart_7acad64a:

    # pc "Right."
    pc "Doğru."

# game/Scenes/Izzy/IzzyDates/izzymoviedate.rpy:64
translate turkish izzymoviedatestart_3dff977c:

    # gl "Cool."
    gl "Harika."

# game/Scenes/Izzy/IzzyDates/izzymoviedate.rpy:68
translate turkish izzymoviedatestart_62737a7b:

    # "We find a seat in the back and chat a bit until the movie starts."
    "Arkada bir yer bulup film başlayana kadar biraz sohbet ediyoruz."

# game/Scenes/Izzy/IzzyDates/izzymoviedate.rpy:73
translate turkish izzymoviedatestart_56f38f5f:

    # "The movie starts and we go quiet."
    "Film başlıyor ve sessizleşiyoruz."

# game/Scenes/Izzy/IzzyDates/izzymoviedate.rpy:75
translate turkish izzymoviedatestart_4c04d5aa:

    # "It's a fun movie and Izzy laughs a lot."
    "Eğlenceli bir film ve Izzy çok gülüyor."

# game/Scenes/Izzy/IzzyDates/izzymoviedate.rpy:77
translate turkish izzymoviedatestart_0edfdae0:

    # "When it ends, she turns to me."
    "Film bittiğinde bana dönüyor."

# game/Scenes/Izzy/IzzyDates/izzymoviedate.rpy:78
translate turkish izzymoviedatestart_4746d3c6:

    # gl "That was pretty damn good, huh?"
    gl "Oldukça iyiydi, değil mi?"

# game/Scenes/Izzy/IzzyDates/izzymoviedate.rpy:79
translate turkish izzymoviedatestart_5867f7ce:

    # "We hang out and chat some while the credits roll."
    "Jenerik akarken biraz takılıp sohbet ediyoruz."

# game/Scenes/Izzy/IzzyDates/izzymoviedate.rpy:83
translate turkish izzymoviedatestart_28be3ae8:

    # "When the credits end, I drive Izzy back to her house."
    "Jenerik bittiğinde Izzy’yi evine bırakıyorum."

# game/Scenes/Izzy/IzzyDates/izzymoviedate.rpy:84
translate turkish izzymoviedatestart_2a5b6b89:

    # "I pull into her driveway and she turns to look at me."
    "Arabayı garaj yoluna çekiyorum ve o bana bakmak için dönüyor."

# game/Scenes/Izzy/IzzyDates/izzymoviedate.rpy:86
translate turkish izzymoviedatestart_6dd86d8c:

    # gl "So, do you want to come inside and fuck a little?"
